# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte, and frozen since its recorder went with the C# core host on 2026-11-07 - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command search
usage 1   search <space> <val> [<w>]    start a new search: find every address currently equal to <val>
usage 2                                 (width <w> in bytes: 1, 2, or 4 - default 1, little-endian)
usage 3   search refine <val>           narrow the current search to addresses now equal to <val>
usage 4   search changed|unchanged      narrow to addresses whose value did/didn't change since last search/refine
usage 5   search increased|decreased    narrow to addresses whose value went up/down since last search/refine
usage 6   search list [<count>]         list current candidate addresses + values (default 20)
usage 7   search reset                  clear the current search

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ search RAM 0
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end
